@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Trang chu 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Danh sach 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao hop le 201 va Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"dtc245200851","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/dtc245200851/CNTTK23E"}

### 4. Doc lai 200, graded sau 3 giay
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Thieu du lieu 400
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"","repositoryUrl":""}

### 6. Bai khong ton tai 404
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"dtc245200851","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/repo"}

### 7. Luot nop khong ton tai 404
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Negotiate 200
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai hub 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
